ication - Preventing \"Model Collapse\":** The classifier developed in this research serves as a foundational technology. It can be evolved into an advanced algorithm to **filter AI-generated data from future training sets,** thereby preventing the degenerative feedback loop known as \"Model Collapse\" and ensuring the long-term health of the AI ecosystem.",
